insert into shots (shot_id,clip_id,shot_index,tc_in,tc_out,duration_s,verbatim_text,description,subject_role,action,food_item,food_role,setting,camera_framing,camera_angle,camera_movement,motion_speed,lighting,vfx,mood) values ('APX-S-5367-1','APX-C-5367',1,0,5,5,'[00:00 - 00:05]. smooth frontal tracking shot. camera moving backward closely in front of the woman while capturing only upper body and half-body composition. she slowly hikes along a narrow mountain trail surrounded by endless green hills and pine trees. realistic movement of jacket and hair from fresh mountain wind. sunlight softly illuminating the scene. peaceful emotional atmosphere. cinematic realism.
insert into shots (shot_id,clip_id,shot_index,tc_in,tc_out,duration_s,verbatim_text,description,subject_role,action,food_item,food_role,setting,camera_framing,camera_angle,camera_movement,motion_speed,lighting,vfx,mood) values ('APX-S-5367-2','APX-C-5367',2,5,8,3,'[00:05 - 00:08]. the woman naturally walks past the camera. while passing beside the lens she softly says in Korean, "Trust me... this scenery is worth it." in a calm warm tone. subtle natural lip sync. cinematic realism. immediately after speaking, the camera smoothly rotates into a rear over-the-shoulder tracking shot without cuts. still maintaining close half-body framing from behind while following her continuing the hike toward the open mountain viewpoint.
insert into shots (shot_id,clip_id,shot_index,tc_in,tc_out,duration_s,verbatim_text,description,subject_role,action,food_item,food_role,setting,camera_framing,camera_angle,camera_movement,motion_speed,lighting,vfx,mood) values ('APX-S-5367-3','APX-C-5367',3,8,15,7,'[00:08 - 00:15]. the woman finally reaches the scenic viewpoint at the top of the hill and slowly stops. she quietly admires the extraordinary panoramic landscape in front of her. then slowly opens both arms wide to the sides, embracing the cool mountain air and the incredible scenery. the camera remains relatively close behind her in a soft half-body composition. beautifully capturing the emotional moment while endless green valleys, pine-covered hills, distant mountain ranges, dramatic clouds, and warm golden sunlight fill the horizon.
