Visual: A digital timer is frantically counting down: 00:04, 00:03. Large beads of sweat roll down a man''s forehead. He is wearing extremely heavy, professional green bomb disposal gear and a tactical helmet, his hands trembling as he holds a huge pair of pliers, staring intensely at the intertwined red and blue wires. The atmosphere is extremely oppressive, with only heavy breathing and a loud heartbeat in the background.','A digital timer counts down as a man in heavy protective gear sweats and trembles, gripping pliers over tangled wires in an oppressive, dim setting.','agent','none','none','none','abandoned warehouse','ecu','eye','handheld','real-time','cold blue tone','none','intense') on conflict (shot_id) do update set clip_id=excluded.clip_id, shot_index=excluded.shot_index, tc_in=excluded.tc_in, tc_out=excluded.tc_out, duration_s=excluded.duration_s, verbatim_text=excluded.verbatim_text, description=excluded.description, subject_role=excluded.subject_role, action=excluded.action, food_item=excluded.food_item, food_role=excluded.food_role, setting=excluded.setting, camera_framing=excluded.camera_framing, camera_angle=excluded.camera_angle, camera_movement=excluded.camera_movement, motion_speed=excluded.motion_speed, lighting=excluded.lighting, vfx=excluded.vfx, mood=excluded.mood;
Action: A female assistant next to him, also in full bomb disposal gear, closes her eyes in despair, shaking her head and screaming heart-wrenchingly. The man lets out a heroic roar, closes his eyes with a look of ready-to-die resolve, and the pliers squeeze hard, cutting the red wire. The timer hits 00:00 with an extremely sharp, loud ''Beep—''. The image freezes at the moment before the explosion.','His partner shakes her head in despair as he braces himself and cuts a wire. The timer hits zero with a sharp beep and the frame freezes.','agent','none','none','none','abandoned warehouse','medium','low','static','slow-mo','cold blue tone','none','intense') on conflict (shot_id) do update set clip_id=excluded.clip_id, shot_index=excluded.shot_index, tc_in=excluded.tc_in, tc_out=excluded.tc_out, duration_s=excluded.duration_s, verbatim_text=excluded.verbatim_text, description=excluded.description, subject_role=excluded.subject_role, action=excluded.action, food_item=excluded.food_item, food_role=excluded.food_role, setting=excluded.setting, camera_framing=excluded.camera_framing, camera_angle=excluded.camera_angle, camera_movement=excluded.camera_movement, motion_speed=excluded.motion_speed, lighting=excluded.lighting, vfx=excluded.vfx, mood=excluded.mood;
Visual: There was no bomb at all. The glowing object with the countdown turns out to be an extremely advanced smart rice cooker. As the ''beep'' ends, the rice cooker lid clicks open, gushing with thick, enticing steam. The male and female leads, who were just ready to die, are still wearing the extremely mismatched heavy bomb disposal gear, but their expressions have instantly turned into ecstatic foodies. The man flips open his helmet visor and gives a thumb up to the camera, revealing a wildly exaggerated and greasy Thai-style eight-tooth smile. The female lead suddenly has a bowl and chopsticks in her hand, staring at the rice cooker and swallowing. Colorful Thai promotional text and funny sound effects pop up crudely around the screen.','The scene cuts to a bright, warm kitchen: there was no bomb, only a smart rice cooker finishing its cycle. Still in their mismatched gear, the pair instantly turn into thrilled, hungry foodies, grinning and reaching for bowls.','chef','serving','rice','hero','family kitchen','wide','eye','static','real-time','bright warm kitchen light','steam','comedic') on conflict (shot_id) do update set clip_id=excluded.clip_id, shot_index=excluded.shot_index, tc_in=excluded.tc_in, tc_out=excluded.tc_out, duration_s=excluded.duration_s, verbatim_text=excluded.verbatim_text, description=excluded.description, subject_role=excluded.subject_role, action=excluded.action, food_item=excluded.food_item, food_role=excluded.food_role, setting=excluded.setting, camera_framing=excluded.camera_framing, camera_angle=excluded.camera_angle, camera_movement=excluded.camera_movement, motion_speed=excluded.motion_speed, lighting=excluded.lighting, vfx=excluded.vfx, mood=excluded.mood;
